in this repository comes from doop and keeps its authors' copyright.

Diazo is its own project. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by doop or its
maintainer. "doop" and the Disc-D logo are its owner's trademarks; Diazo does
not use them in anything a user sees. Internal identifiers (data-doop-*
attributes, DOOP_* variables, table, package and tool names) keep the old name
so data and integrations do not break; they are not branding.

